Bicep: resource of type Microsoft.DocumentDB/databaseAccounts. Example snippet:
resource docdb 'Microsoft.DocumentDB/databaseAccounts@2021-04-15' = {
  name: 'myDocDbAccount'
  location: 'westus2'
  kind: 'MongoDB'
  properties: { ... }
}
Terraform (azurerm provider): azurerm_cosmosdb_account for the account; ancillary resources include azurerm_cosmosdb_mongo_database and azurerm_cosmosdb_mongo_collection for DB/collection objects.
